WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
The first forward throw knocks Ryu down in the corner.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:02.800
Akuma dashes toward the waking opponent.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.400
Standing medium kick hits Ryu as he rises.

4
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.000
Crouching medium punch continues the wake-up confirm.

5
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.050
Light Tatsu lifts Ryu into the heavy Tatsu follow-up.

6
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.750
Heavy Tatsu completes the wake-up conversion.
